    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>12,067</td>
      <td>Hari Seldon goes on trial by the Commission of Public Safety, and the Encyclopedia Galactica Foundation is exiled to/established on Terminus (Events of “The Psychohistorians” in Foundation)</td>
